<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Thus I cast the world behind me;</l><l>Jesus most beloved shall be;</l><l>Beauteous more than all things beauteous,</l><l>He alone is joy to me.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Bright with all eternal radiance</l><l>Is the glory of Thy face;</l><l>Thou art loving, sweet, and tender,</l><l>Full of pity, full of grace.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>When I hated, Thou didst love me,</l><l>Shedd’st for me Thy precious blood;</l><l>Still Thou lovest, lovest ever,</l><l>Shall I not love Thee, my God?</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Keep my heart still faithful to Thee,</l><l>That my earthly life may be</l><l>But a shadow to that glory</l><l>Of my hidden life in Thee.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
